      "claim": "The overwhelming majority of people take laxatives to treat constipation or for medical bowel preparation, not for recreational purposes.",
      "evidence": "Pharmacological definitions and clinical guidelines identify constipation relief and bowel prep as the primary indications for laxative use; epidemiological data shows these are the dominant reasons for consumption.",
